&lt;li&gt;
&lt;p data-renderer-start-pos=&quot;1049&quot; data-local-id=&quot;63a94cd52700&quot;&gt;Track the market: open-source models, inference economics, and how businesses actually apply AI. Turn what you see into product bets.&lt;/p&gt;
