&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;A&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;BOUT TIDE&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;At Tide, we help SMEs save time and money in the running of their businesses by not only offering business accounts and related banking services, but also a comprehensive set of highly usable and connected administrative solutions, from invoicing to accounting.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Tide is transforming the small business banking market and now supports over 2 million members globally across the UK, India, Germany and France.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Using advanced technology, all solutions are designed with SMEs in mind. With quick onboarding, low fees and innovative features, we thrive on making data driven decisions to serve our mission: to help SMEs save time and money so they can get back to doing what they love.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Tide facts:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Tide is available for UK, Indian, German and French SMEs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over 2 million members globally and rapidly growing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Over $300 million raised in funding&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;3,000 Tideans globally&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recognised with Great Place to Work certification three years in a row, and among India’s Top 50 Best Workplaces in Banking, Financial Services, and Insurance in 2026&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We have offices in Central London, with a member support and technology centre in Sofia, Bulgaria, technology centres in Serbia, Romania, Lithuania and Hyderabad and offices in Gurugram, New Delhi, Berlin, Paris and Luxembourg&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About You&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We’re looking for a Senior Paid Social Manager who can strategically lead and scale our acquisition efforts across paid social channels in the UK and Europe. You’ll bring deep expertise in managing multi-million-pound budgets, a data-driven approach, and a proven track record of driving large-scale growth. You will be responsible for leading strategy, execution, and innovation in our paid social performance, ensuring we stay ahead of platform changes and industry trends. You’ll also have a clear view on how AI is changing performance marketing, and you’ll build a team that uses it well.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You’ll be a Meta expert, with hands-on experience across bidding strategies, audience segmentation, attribution, and creative testing. Additionally, you’ll have experience scaling campaigns across TikTok, Twitter, LinkedIn. You’ll be a martech-savvy professional, comfortable with tracking solutions, first-party data activation, working with MMPs and advanced attribution modeling.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;You will play a key role in shaping Tide’s international expansion and long-term paid social strategy, ensuring that performance marketing continues to be a key growth driver. This is an opportunity to lead and grow Tide’s in-house Paid Social team as an AI-enabled team, making a significant impact on the business.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Some of the things you’ll be doing:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Owning and scaling paid social performance globally&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring we maximise efficiency and return on investment across all platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Managing and optimising multi-million-pound budgets&lt;/strong&gt;, using advanced bidding strategies and automation tools to drive sustained growth.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building an AI-enabled paid social team&lt;/strong&gt;, deciding which work AI should handle (creative production, reporting, bid and budget management) and which stays with people, then training the team to work that way.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Embedding AI into creative and testing workflows&lt;/strong&gt;, using generative tools to develop concepts, copy and variants faster, with clear quality, brand and compliance checks.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Using AI and automation across the account&lt;/strong&gt;, from platform tools such as Advantage+ to custom scripts, agents and reporting workflows that cut manual work.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Developing and executing the paid social roadmap&lt;/strong&gt;, identifying new opportunities, testing innovative strategies, and expanding our presence across emerging platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Driving a full-funnel approach&lt;/strong&gt;, from awareness campaigns to high-intent lead generation and conversion, leveraging creative and audience insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Collaborating with cross-functional teams&lt;/strong&gt; (Data, Product, Web, Creative, and more) to align paid social strategies with Tide’s wider growth objectives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Championing attribution and measurement&lt;/strong&gt;, ensuring best-in-class tracking, incrementality testing, and first-party data activation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Leading creative strategy&lt;/strong&gt;, working closely with designers and copywriters to continuously test and optimise assets for performance.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Staying ahead of industry changes&lt;/strong&gt;, including privacy regulations (SKAD, ATT, IFDA), &lt;strong&gt;AI-driven platform updates&lt;/strong&gt;, and new advertising solutions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Building and mentoring a high-performing, AI-literate paid social team&lt;/strong&gt;, shaping the function as we scale both in the UK and internationally.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;You’ll be a great fit if:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have 7+ years of experience in paid social marketing, managing large-scale campaigns across multiple platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a proven track record of driving large volumes of B2B acquisition through paid social.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re an expert in Meta advertising (Facebook &amp;amp; Instagram), with deep knowledge of bidding strategies, audience segmentation, and ad creative best practices.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have extensive hands-on experience with LinkedIn Ads, Twitter, TikTok, and other secondary paid social platforms.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re highly analytical, comfortable with incrementality testing, MMM, and data-driven decision-making.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have strong technical knowledge of tracking solutions, attribution modeling, and martech tools (Appsflyer, GA4, GTM, CDPs, Looker/Tableau, etc.).&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have hands-on experience using AI in marketing, such as generative tools for creative and copy, LLMs for analysis, and automation for reporting and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience building or leading a team that uses AI day to day, including setting standards, sharing prompts and workflows, and measuring the productivity gain.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re comfortable with Meta’s AI-led campaign products (Advantage+, automated bidding) and know when to trust automation and when to override it.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have sound judgement on AI risk, including brand safety, accuracy of claims and data privacy, ideally in a regulated industry such as financial services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You understand how to drive performance across web traffic, mobile apps, and lead generation channels.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have a test-and-learn mindset, with a structured approach to experimentation and optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You can effectively communicate complex insights, using data visualisation tools to tell compelling performance stories.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You have experience managing agency relationships, but also thrive in an in-house, hands-on environment.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;You’re a natural leader, with experience mentoring and growing a team of paid social professionals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Fluency in a second language (French or German) is preferable.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h3&gt;&lt;strong&gt;What you’ll get in return:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Make work, work for you! We embrace flexible working and remote-first arrangements.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;25 days holiday + bank holidays.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Vitality Health and Dental Insurance, with a proactive focus on mental and physical well-being.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;£1,000 L&amp;amp;D budget per year, plus up to three L&amp;amp;D paid days off.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Enhanced family-friendly leave.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work abroad for up to 90 days a year.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Snacks, drinks, and social events in our offices.&lt;/li&gt;
